<article class="env-definition" id="0BU4">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0BU4">Definition <span data-tag="0BU4">15.114.7</span>.</a> With assumptions and notation as in Lemma <a href="/tag/09EE" data-tag="09EE">15.114.5</a>. </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
The <em>wild inertia group of $\mathfrak m$</em> is the subgroup $P$. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
The <em>tame inertia group of $\mathfrak m$</em> is the quotient $I \to I_ t$. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
  <p> We denote $\theta : I \to \mu _ e(\kappa (\mathfrak m))$ the surjective map (<a href="/tag/0BU3" data-tag="0BU3">15.114.5.1</a>) whose kernel is $P$ and which induces the isomorphism $I_ t \to \mu _ e(\kappa (\mathfrak m))$. </p>
</article>